{"seq":2,"slug":"lc0032-longest-valid-parentheses","title":"LeetCode 32 最长有效括号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-dp-advanced/lc0032-longest-valid-parentheses","wordCount":646,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-32-最长有效括号\">LeetCode 32 最长有效括号</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个只包含 <code>&#39;(&#39;</code> 和 <code>&#39;)&#39;</code> 的字符串，找出最长有效（格式正确且连续）括号子串的长度。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 3 × 10^4</code></li>\n<li><code>s[i]</code> 为 <code>&#39;(&#39;</code> 或 <code>&#39;)&#39;</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s = &quot;(()&quot;&#10;输出：2&#10;解释：最长有效括号子串是 &quot;()&quot;。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"(()\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：最长有效括号子串是 \"()\"。</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s = &quot;)()())&quot;&#10;输出：4&#10;解释：最长有效括号子串是 &quot;()()&quot;。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \")()())\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：最长有效括号子串是 \"()()\"。</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s = &quot;&quot;&#10;输出：0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：0</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 4：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s = &quot;()(())&quot;&#10;输出：6&#10;解释：整个字符串都是有效括号。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"()(())\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：整个字符串都是有效括号。</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题有三种经典解法：动态规划、栈、双指针（贪心）。</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：动态规划</strong></p>\n<p>定义 <code>dp[i]</code> 为以 <code>s[i]</code> 结尾的最长有效括号长度。只有 <code>s[i] === &#39;)&#39;</code> 时 <code>dp[i]</code> 才可能大于 0。</p>\n<p>两种情况：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>s[i] = &#39;)&#39;</code> 且 <code>s[i-1] = &#39;(&#39;</code>：形成 <code>...()</code> 模式，<code>dp[i] = dp[i-2] + 2</code></li>\n<li><code>s[i] = &#39;)&#39;</code> 且 <code>s[i-1] = &#39;)&#39;</code>：形成 <code>...))</code> 模式，需要找到内部有效括号对应的左括号之前的位置</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对于情况 2，设 <code>j = i - dp[i-1] - 1</code>。如果 <code>s[j] = &#39;(&#39;</code>，则 <code>dp[i] = dp[i-1] + 2 + dp[j-1]</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：栈</strong></p>\n<p>栈中维护<strong>未匹配的括号索引</strong>。初始时压入 <code>-1</code> 作为&quot;虚拟底部&quot;。遇到 <code>&#39;(&#39;</code> 压入索引，遇到 <code>&#39;)&#39;</code> 弹出栈顶：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果栈为空，说明当前 <code>)</code> 无法匹配，将其索引压入作为新的分隔点</li>\n<li>如果栈不为空，当前有效长度为 <code>i - 栈顶索引</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>方法三：双指针（贪心）</strong></p>\n<p>正向扫描：维护左右括号计数，右 &gt; 左时重置；左 = 右时更新答案。反向扫描：维护左右括号计数，左 &gt; 右时重置；左 = 右时更新答案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[三种解法]&#10;    A --&gt; B[动态规划]&#10;    A --&gt; C[栈]&#10;    A --&gt; D[双指针贪心]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[dp[i] = 以 s[i] 结尾的最长有效长度&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[栈维护未匹配括号索引]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2[匹配时: 长度 = i - 栈顶]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[正向扫描 + 反向扫描]&#10;    D1 --&gt; D2[左右计数相等时更新]\">graph TD\n    A[三种解法]\n    A --&gt; B[动态规划]\n    A --&gt; C[栈]\n    A --&gt; D[双指针贪心]\n    B --&gt; B1[dp[i] = 以 s[i] 结尾的最长有效长度\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[栈维护未匹配括号索引]\n    C1 --&gt; C2[匹配时: 长度 = i - 栈顶]\n    D --&gt; D1[正向扫描 + 反向扫描]\n    D1 --&gt; D2[左右计数相等时更新]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动态规划</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>思维量大，需处理多种情况</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栈</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>最直观，面试推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双指针</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>空间最优，需两次扫描</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>栈解法：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function longestValidParentheses(s: string): number {&#10;  const stack: number[] = [-1];&#10;  let maxLen = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; s.length; i++) {&#10;    if (s[i] === &#39;(&#39;) {&#10;      stack.push(i);&#10;    } else {&#10;      stack.pop();&#10;      if (stack.length === 0) {&#10;        stack.push(i);&#10;      } else {&#10;        maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, i - stack[stack.length - 1]);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return maxLen;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> longestValidParentheses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxLen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (s[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '('</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        maxLen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxLen, i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stack[stack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxLen;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>动态规划解法：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function longestValidParenthesesDP(s: string): number {&#10;  const n = s.length;&#10;  const dp = new Array(n).fill(0);&#10;  let maxLen = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    if (s[i] === &#39;)&#39;) {&#10;      if (s[i - 1] === &#39;(&#39;) {&#10;        dp[i] = (i &gt;= 2 ? dp[i - 2] : 0) + 2;&#10;      } else if (dp[i - 1] &gt; 0) {&#10;        const j = i - dp[i - 1] - 1;&#10;        if (j &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; s[j] === &#39;(&#39;) {&#10;          dp[i] = dp[i - 1] + 2 + (j &gt;= 1 ? dp[j - 1] : 0);&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;      maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, dp[i]);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return maxLen;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark