24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxLen, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxLen;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>双指针为什么需要两次扫描？</strong> 正向扫描时，如果 <code>left &gt; right</code>（左括号更多），我们无法确定最终是否能匹配。例如 <code>&quot;(()&quot;</code> 正向扫描结束时 left=2, right=1，永远不相等。反向扫描弥补了这一点——它能检测到左括号过多的情况。两次扫描结合覆盖了所有场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>栈</th>\n<th>DP</th>\n<th>双指针</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 三种方法都只需线性扫描字符串，每个字符处理时间为 O(1)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 栈和 DP 都需要 O(n) 额外空间。双指针只用几个变量，O(1) 空间。如果面试中要求空间优化，双指针是终极选择。</p>\n<p><strong>面试推荐：</strong> 栈解法最直观，容易讲清楚。DP 解法展示了 DP 建模能力。双指针解法体现了对问题的深入理解。建议先讲栈解法，面试官追问时再展示双指针。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 32 最长有效括号","id":"leetcode-32-最长有效括号"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 10 正则表达式匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-dp-advanced/lc0010-regular-expression-matching"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 72 编辑距离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-dp-advanced/lc0072-edit-distance"}}